// Copy to `Secrets.xcconfig` (gitignored) and fill in. Config.xcconfig picks it up via `#include?`.
// Same shape as Faint's mobile/iosApp/Configuration. Info.plist forwards each value as
// `$(KEY)`, and DemoKit's `bootstrapDemoKoinWithSdks()` reads them from NSBundle at launch.
//
// REQUIRED — the same `frnk-demo` project keys `local.properties` holds for demo-android
// (POSTHOG_API_KEY / POSTHOG_HOST / SENTRY_DSN). A blank value fails at launch naming the key.
// xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so write URLs with "$()" splitting the slashes:
//   SENTRY_DSN = https:/$()/<key>@<org>.ingest.sentry.io/<project>
//   POSTHOG_HOST = https:/$()/us.i.posthog.com   (blank = PostHog Cloud US)
SENTRY_DSN =
POSTHOG_API_KEY =
POSTHOG_HOST =

// RevenueCat Test Store key (test_ prefix) — routes purchases to the Test Store, no App Store
// Connect needed (BACKLOG P3-3). Public key of the throwaway `frnk-demo` project.
REVENUECAT_API_KEY = test_qzjfFbAulTeDyCvtBnxOHsrKucH
